## 10. TESTING AND QUALITY GATES

Do not assume the application works because the code was generated. Use the terminal and the browser to run real checks, and record the actual output.

### 10.1 Official sample evaluation

Run all 32 sample cases and compare with `sample_output.csv` according to the official evaluation rules. Report every mismatch and fix the underlying general logic. Never hardcode sample answers and never modify expected outputs.

